{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03343","headline":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制 · 宋之问","name":"奉和幸长安故城未央宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉王未息战，萧相乃营宫。\n壮丽一朝尽，威灵千载空。\n皇明怅前迹，置酒宴羣公。\n寒轻彩仗外，春发幔城中。\n乐思回斜日，歌词继大风。\n今朝天子贵，不假叔孙通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}